j.
Not allow permit (“sticker”) parking; all parking will be fully paid.

k.
Restore the ground surface in “E” lot to its condition prior to the 2023
Cheyenne Frontier Days celebration.

l.
Provide an accounting of revenue and expenses for all revenue producing
areas following the end of the 2023 Cheyenne Frontier Days celebration.
Such accounting shall be submitted to the City Clerk no later than
November 1, 2023.

m.
Provide for responsible use of the City of Cheyenne Kiwanis Community
